[3361]="7007187D\n1\tFind potential rot in Sul Madásh\tRáthwil fears the blight is seeping into Sul Madásh more than the people know. She has asked you to investigate areas around the settlement and gather samples to be checked for rot.\n2\tGather blight samples (total: 3)\tRáthwil fears the blight is seeping into Sul Madásh more than the people know. She has asked you to investigate areas around the settlement and gather samples to be checked for rot.\n3\tFind potential rot in Sul Madásh\tRáthwil fears the blight is seeping into Sul Madásh more than the people know. She has asked you to investigate areas around the settlement and gather samples to be checked for rot.\n4\tGather blight samples (total: 3)\tRáthwil fears the blight is seeping into Sul Madásh more than the people know. She has asked you to investigate areas around the settlement and gather samples to be checked for rot.\n5\tFind potential rot in Sul Madásh\tRáthwil fears the blight is seeping into Sul Madásh more than the people know. She has asked you to investigate areas around the settlement and gather samples to be checked for rot.\n6\tGather blight samples (total: 2)\tRáthwil fears the blight is seeping into Sul Madásh more than the people know. She has asked you to investigate areas around the settlement and gather samples to be checked for rot.\n7\tReturn to Ráthwil with the samples\tYou have gathered various samples of potential rot from within Sul Madásh. Return to Ráthwil with the samples so that she can begin her research.\n",
[3362]="70059919\n1\tSearch the northern Wildwood\030Search the western Wildwood\030Search the central Wildwood\030Search the eastern Wildwood\030Search the southern Wildwood\030Assist Thornmane in the Wildwood\tThornmane believes signs of the Entwives may be found across the Wildwood. Search the Wildwood for signs of the Entwives.\n2\tTalk to Thornmane\tThornmane can be found in the Wildwood. You should talk to Thornmane.\n",
[3363]="70015E15\n1\tRetrieve what was taken from the Company's camp-site\tThe remaining half-orc might be found along the northern banks of the dry Sirannon river-bed, south-east of Echad Eregion. Golgallon suggests that there is a chance to stop the remaining half-orc when he stops to rest his horse. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n2\tBring the pot to Golgallon\tGolgallon is at Echad Eregion, north-west of the Sirannon. You should bring the pot you found back to Golgallon.\n",
[3364]="70051128\n1\tEnter the Wistmead wheat maze\tThe Wistmead wheat maze can be found in the Wistmead Harvest Festival space. Ermentrude Haybank has challenged you to get through the wheat maze, from start to finish, before the time runs out.\n2\tFind your way out before the time expires\tThe exit to the wheat-maze is around here somewhere... or is it? You should try to find your way out of the wheat maze before the time runs out. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n3\tTalk to Ermentrude Haybank\tThe Wistmead wheat maze can be found in the Wistmead Harvest Festival space. You should talk to Ermentrude Haybank at the wheat maze entrance.\n",
