[3369]="7006672F\n1\tAlagiel has asked you to check the chickens of Lothgobel for eggs.\t\n2\tTalk to Alagiel\tTell Alagiel that you have checked all the chickens for eggs.\n",
[3370]="7006B679\n1\tCollect frogs from the traps (total: 6)\tThe frog traps can be found in the marshes of the delta west of Iridír.\n2\tBring the frogs to Zildug in Iridír\tYou have collected all the frogs from the traps. You should bring them to Zildug in Iridír.\n",
[3371]="7003FFBE\n1\tSearch houses (total: 3)\tThe houses must be searched.\n",
[3372]="7006B607\n1\tTalk to Sûlmur\tTurizi would like you to check on the welfare of Sûlmur at her papyrus farm in Ambarûl, east of Ekagar.\n",
[3373]="7001B226\n1\tDefeat Gazbúrz\030Defeat Tarkrîp bow-masters (total: 8)\030Defeat Tarkrîp bone-smashers (total: 8)\tYou have been instructed to search east along the gorge far to the north of the Bree-fields, beyond Hengstacer Farm, for an Orc-leader and his entourage. Andreg fears that the Orcs have pushed too deeply into Bree-land, though only a small number of Orcs came through Trestlebridge. This concerns him greatly. He sent you to investigate and to strike a blow against the Orcs.\n2\tTalk to Andreg at the Old Greenway Fort\tAndreg is at the Old Greenway Fort You should return to Andreg and tell him about the Orc camp that you discovered along the gorge in the northern most reaches of Bree-land.\n",
[3374]="70046C51\n1\tCollect Saithe from fishing traps (total: 10)\tFish traps can be found around the shores of either of the Cape islands. You should check the traps for fish.\n2\tTalk to Haldil\tHaldil is down by the Cape Docks. You should speak to Haldil when you have a moment.\n",
[3375]="70019A99\n1\tArrive outside of Glân Vraig\tSurvive the trip to Glân Vraig.\n",
[3376]="7006C138\n1\tSpeak with the farmer Mushêndu\tSpeak with the farmer Mushêndu.\n2\tRecover the first escaped chicken\030Recover the second escaped chicken\030Recover the third escaped chicken\030Recover the fourth escaped chicken\tRecover Mushêndu's escaped chickens.\n3\tSpeak with Mushêndu\tSpeak with Mushêndu outside the chicken pen.\n4\tSpeak with Mushêndu\tSpeak with Mushêndu outside the chicken pen.\n5\tFind the scout\tFind the scout.\n",
[3377]="70015E26\n1\tThe summoning horn is at the northern foot of a bridge in Barad Morlas, south-west of Echad Eregion. Lengliel has asked you to use the summoning horn of Barad Morlas to challenge Horngoth, the leader of the half-orcs there.\t\n2\tTalk to Lengliel at Echad Eregion\tLengliel is at Echad Eregion, north-east of Barad Morlas. You should return to Lengliel and tell her of your victory at Barad Morlas.\n",
[3378]="700173A6\n1\tDefeat Chieftain Gûrsh\tChieftain Gûrsh, leader of the northern forces of Angmar, can be found in the Library at Tham Mírdain, just to the south-west of Echad Mirobel. Ornras of Echad Mirobel has asked you to take a small band of fighters and unseat Chieftan Gûrsh, which will hopefully weaken the enemy presence from the north without drawing the attention of the south. Enemies have been scavenging the Library for forgotten history that might be useful to their cause.\n",
[3379]="7002EE5E\n1\tDefeat Henmaru\t\n2\tDefeat Henmaru\tThe draug-chieftain probably dwells somewhere in the depths of their cave. You should hunt for the draug-chieftain and put an end to its existence.\n3\tTalk to someone at Eaworth\tThere are Rohirrim at Eaworth, south of the Wódfen. You should bring news of your victory against Henmaru to the Rohirrim.\n",
[3380]="7004A8EE\n1\tDestroy clusters of eggs in Cirith Ungol (total: 12)\tClusters of eggs can be found throughout Cirith Ungol, but primarily in the Tower of Cirith Ungol. While repelling the spiders in Cirith Ungol, you have encountered numerous clusters of eggs laid in the shadows of the tower. You should destroy them.\n2\tCompleted\tYou have destroyed many clusters of eggs in Cirith Ungol.\n",
[3381]="7004185D\n1\tSpeak to someone in Malbarth about travelling east\tMalbarth can be found to the north of Sarnhad in western Lebennin. Erianir has asked you to travel north to Malbarth before journeying east in Lebennin as the Corsair and Haradrim forces have seized much of the eastern lands.\n",
[3382]="70022B34\n1\tDefeat Chilled Barrow-wights (total: 6)\tChilled Barrow-wights can be found within the Flooded Wing of the Great Barrow.\n",
[3383]="7000BF12\n1\tSearch Gauradan-baskets (total: 4)\tThe Gauradan-camps lie to the south of Thorgest's dwelling. Thorgest has asked you to search through the camps of the Gauredain in the hopes of finding some cure for the affliction they have placed upon him.\n2\tTalk to Thorgest\tThorgest's dwelling is to the north of the Gauradan camps. You should bring the Gauradan-relics you have collected to Thorgest to see if he can discover a cure among them.\n",
[3384]="70058925\n1\tGather a sample of dragon claw\030Gather a sample of dragon horn\030Gather a sample of dragon rib\030Gather a sample of dragon spine\030Gather a sample of dragon tooth\tDragon skeletons can be found in Malkorlash, in northern Elderslade. Lore-master Rúni has asked you to get samples of dragon bones.\n2\tReturn to Rúni\tLore-master Rúni is at Zudramdân in Elderslade. You should bring the dragon samples to Lore-master Rúni.\n",
[3385]="7004A8ED\n1\tDefeat spiders at the gates of Durthang in Lhingris (total: 10)\tSpiders can be found near the gates of Durthang in Lhingris. You have encountered numerous spiders setting siege to Durthang in Lhingris and should defeat them.\n2\tCompleted\tYou have defeated many spiders at the gates of Durthang in Lhingris.\n",
[3386]="70066BC9\n1\tDefeat cave-claws (total: 10)\tSerric has asked you to reduce the cave-claw infestation in the nearby mountains. Cave-claws have been spotted at the foot of the mountainside west of Ost Arndír.\n2\tReturn to Serric\tYou should let Serric know that you have lessened the number of cave-claws at Rasping-crag. Serric is in Ost Arndír.\n",
[3387]="70045442\n1\tRemove corrupted vines from Púkel-men statues (total: 8)\tCorrupted vines can be found around some of the Púkel-men statues in the Drúadan Forest. You should remove corrupted vines from Púkel-men statues.\n2\tSpeak with Ghân-buri-Ghân\tGhân-buri-Ghân can be found in Drû Bhûta. You should speak with Ghân-buri-Ghân.\n",
[3388]="70062F1A\n1\tChoose a clan and receive their blessing\tThe time has come to choose your clan allegiance. All you need do is speak with one of the emissaries and choose to represent them on the field of battle.\n",
[3389]="70057193\n1\tChop wood (total: 6)\tWood that needs to be chopped can be found at the Beorninghús. You should chop some wood for Grimbeorn.\n",
[3390]="70071E01\n1\tDefeat Huorns in the Moulder-grove (total: 12)\030Burn strange saplings (total: 8)\tDefeat Huorns in the afflicted Moulder-grove and set aflame their saplings.\n2\tFind and defeat Totâkhri, the Rotted Root\tFind and defeat Totâkhri, the Rotted Root.\n",
[3391]="70025EED\n1\tTalk to Albin Northcotton\tAlbin Northcotton is at the market area. Albin Northcotton will want to know that all the chores are done and the farm is ready.\n",
[3392]="70026908\n1\tRead from the Chronicle of Events and complete At the Stone of Erech\tYou have chosen to read from the Chronicle of Events concerning the history of the Oath-breakers and the Paths of the Dead.\n2\tClose the Chronicle of Events\tYou have read from the Chronicle of Events of the history of the Oath-breakers and the Paths of the Dead.\n",
